    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/3f1cb42f24a6262096c1d488637b1aa7.poster.avif?t=1754765293\" width=798 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/3f1cb42f24a6262096c1d488637b1aa7.webm?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/3f1cb42f24a6262096c1d488637b1aa7.mp4?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/a57d5bd8b0a5b69ffee4a514a565c7e9.poster.avif?t=1754765293\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/a57d5bd8b0a5b69ffee4a514a565c7e9.webm?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/a57d5bd8b0a5b69ffee4a514a565c7e9.mp4?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the reincarnation of a fallen hero, a soul once marked by cowardice. Beneath your feet lies a shattered world, cursed by a grieving wizard once betrayed. After centuries in exile, he has returned, burning your village to ash. Now alone in this god-forsaken land, you will find refuge in a crumbling tavern, a place to rebuild, gather outcasts, and plot your path through the darkness that lies ahead. Will you face your fate with courage, or repeat the sins of the past?  <br> <br>Set in a war-torn realm ravaged by vengeful gods, warring kingdoms, and shifting worlds, The Goblin Tavern is an immersive open-world dark fantasy RPG featuring versatile combat, branching narratives, and a world rich in detail, shaped by the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br> <br><strong>Key Features:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/7fcf70c7530a6c81f4fb4385d51bb926.poster.avif?t=1754765293\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/7fcf70c7530a6c81f4fb4385d51bb926.webm?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/7fcf70c7530a6c81f4fb4385d51bb926.mp4?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore vast, interconnected regions where diverse races and monsters roam, each steeped in deep lore and mystery. From the dark, haunted <i>Wyrdwood Forest</i> to the crumbling strongholds of the <i>Threshlands</i>, every location tells a story and hides a secret.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/5906fc3d62423649617e38503da7005b.poster.avif?t=1754765293\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/5906fc3d62423649617e38503da7005b.webm?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/5906fc3d62423649617e38503da7005b.mp4?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in dynamic, skill-based combat that evolves with your chosen path. Wield swords, unleash spells, strike from the shadows, or blend disciplines to forge a build that\u2019s truly your own. Whether you favor brute strength, deadly precision, arcane mastery, or a mix of them all, the combat system supports a wide range of playstyles and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/d54381a110a91ac0732b42b20e89f9ce.poster.avif?t=1754765293\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/d54381a110a91ac0732b42b20e89f9ce.webm?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/d54381a110a91ac0732b42b20e89f9ce.mp4?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Experience the world up close in immersive first-person, or pull back for tactical third-person exploration and combat. Switch perspectives at any time to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/f50c113320dd23ea3c766ef88a5d2148.poster.avif?t=1754765293\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/f50c113320dd23ea3c766ef88a5d2148.webm?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/f50c113320dd23ea3c766ef88a5d2148.mp4?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Forge your identity through dialogue, bonds, and the choices that shape your fate. Every decision sends ripples across the world, altering quests, relationships, and the future itself. The world remembers your deeds, noble or cruel. Allies may turn against you. Towns may burn. Kingdoms may rise. You may ascend into legend\u2026 or wither away in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/4d64e182b0f8aa6ecda6a276187b9842.poster.avif?t=1754765293\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/4d64e182b0f8aa6ecda6a276187b9842.webm?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/4d64e182b0f8aa6ecda6a276187b9842.mp4?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unravel storylines woven with mystery, betrayal, and moral ambiguity. Many quests offer multiple resolutions, each with consequences that echo throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/3f1cb42f24a6262096c1d488637b1aa7.poster.avif?t=1754765293\" width=798 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/3f1cb42f24a6262096c1d488637b1aa7.webm?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846360/extras/3f1cb42f24a6262096c1d488637b1aa7.mp4?t=1754765293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
